      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that breakdown. We're trying to rule out any subtle environmental factors too. We've noticed that sometimes these inconsistencies don't show up in the laboratory settings, but we see them more frequently once the components are integrated into the full assembly and subjected to actual road vibration and varying humidity. Do you think there's a possibility that small, localized contaminants or even minute debris getting lodged in the friction surface could be causing that sudden, erratic drop in performance?",
